{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1641b9f0d8a1d41f229290830b2b27e1b2b95948b567f4e8a12df4fba0a03094", "ja": "『あの子』の為、モーガンの兄を殺し薬を\r\n奪おうとするゼノビア。そこにハーマンが\r\n現れる。ゼノビアはハーマンを殺そうとする\r\nが、イーサンに阻止され連行される。任務を\r\n終えたスタークス達は、自由の身となった。", "zh": "为了『那个孩子』，泽诺比亚杀死了摩根的哥哥，企图夺走药物。赫尔曼就在这时出现了。泽诺比亚想要杀死赫尔曼，却被伊桑阻止并押走。完成任务的斯塔克斯一行人重获自由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1000_003mik", "source_sha256": "c474013e4b9f9ffb00aa3ef4ece3bcd5e7e5bced1cd3cb8132140505c645308f", "ja": "お前は……ゼノビア！？\nどうしてここに……！", "zh": "你是……泽诺比亚！？  \n怎么会在这里……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1001_jimusotyo", "source_sha256": "a89df69a3c3a8809c399260735bd60219e8d03f521eed02d636beaad1eaaa9db", "ja": "ゼノビア！　そのアタッシェケースを持って逃げろ！\n奴らに渡すな！", "zh": "泽诺比亚！带着那个手提箱逃走！\n别交给那些家伙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "35e36ea5d3ba5cd25e3f268ba8e5fc9e5dfeb4de6d033905053d7d4ba2e37cb1", "ja": "あっ、ここまでありがとうね、おじさん～。\n用は済んだから、もう消えていいよ～？", "zh": "啊，谢谢你送我到这里，大叔～  \n事情已经办完了，你可以消失了哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1003_jimusotyo", "source_sha256": "8967866af7940bbb8158ec3b30d825942e330b092b2be389d6b4c06823283eb5", "ja": "なっ……！？", "zh": "什……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "68f56daea37ca35930486bd285c38c027491bc13c5b799c3887a6579cb9ab7fa", "ja": "ゼノビア。\nお前も、このスパークドラッグが狙いなのか？", "zh": "泽诺比亚。\n你也盯上这个火花药剂了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "29618ad3b95006a72c268655086ad1ee2dd7c3e06587f978b45b23abe06c5599", "ja": "ドラッグ～？　う～ん、\n個人的にはどうでもいいんだけどぉ……。", "zh": "药剂～？唔～嗯，\n对我个人来说倒是无所谓啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "5f481af2587ee3460829d8ffc51876674d61e07b0be903a82842862f5f159bec", "ja": "でも、それを奪われちゃうと……\n『あの子』が困るんだよねぇ。", "zh": "不过，要是那个被抢走的话……\n“那孩子”会很为难的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "03f9a6ecb18e7c479f74189790079ed4dd03534d47cc3a719a13f0a8dacb1ba0", "ja": "あの子……？", "zh": "那个孩子……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1008_jimusotyo", "source_sha256": "8ec4037268e58aaaf656813afb30a0e7d2b4d7d95ea198926c55260a0ba1867f", "ja": "ゼノビア、何をしている！\n早くそのケースを、あの方に……！", "zh": "泽诺比亚，你在做什么！\n快把那个箱子交给那位大人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "9c22d83bcd596fdf0b42a0b1d0b90132640919e9ccae022e3780cba08fa7dc10", "ja": "煩いなぁ。消えろって言ってるでしょ。", "zh": "吵死了。我不是说了让你滚吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1010_null", "source_sha256": "44ce8c6d60e264c18472ab075d5ae789de004d5d5e4834ef618f62eafc34c5e1", "ja": "ヒュッ！", "zh": "咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1011_jimusotyo", "source_sha256": "1491885f0db89e04fcd04719a373dacc3fc68c351ec793c1383fdd15d50d4eea", "ja": "ごふっ！？　……ぐ、あ……。", "zh": "呃噗！？……咕、啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "434fab29bee281fd41488fea79afdec31378ade9a21dad5d60d4f51d44f04850", "ja": "っ！？　お兄様……！", "zh": "呃！？哥哥大人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "3f13809b80eb9e5b38ed68e41bfcd533cd292f8c3e55afa8d98278aa2b083151", "ja": "何故殺した？\n……そいつは、お前の依頼者じゃないのか？", "zh": "为什么杀了他？\n……那家伙，不是你的委托人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "df8a2dc44d99e149329e2e0721100ca2e693007fa5eab915cca0fa96434a32fe", "ja": "何故……？　ん～、何故って言われても……\n煩いし、邪魔だから～……？　それに……。", "zh": "为什么……？唔～你问我为什么，我也……  \n因为很吵，又碍事吧～……？而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1015_se", "source_sha256": "fcbe34e9a319b880d975e94771dbd21aabf2488e0f47ab2f67a6eb9644efd187", "ja": "カツ、カツ、カツ……", "zh": "嗒、嗒、嗒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c446458f146b2d4c2a6e508e993891d4babf992ffd241765342f8ca74afc3bfd", "ja": "やり過ぎです、ゼノビア。\n私は貴方に、人を殺していいとは言っていません。", "zh": "做得太过分了，泽诺比亚。\n我可没说过你可以杀人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "79fd9b32e0f46f79afaae796d55fa31f852ca2c3272dbae2abd03c8c4c2b8ebb", "ja": "あっ、来たきた～！\n待ってたよ、アンバ～……。", "zh": "啊，来了来了～！\n我等你好久了，安柏——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "823d41e5d2f63176eef2ad0d81953223835a88000aeda6f697c7d793d2ac136a", "ja": "アンバー……？", "zh": "琥珀……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "6f9b715f6ceea16e927d0efc9f2d9c575e8f364c37189d0df0c940bac7b13244", "ja": "あ、今はアンバーじゃなくてハーマン……？\nどっちだろ～？", "zh": "啊，现在不是琥珀，而是哈曼……？\n到底是哪一个呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "f28649b427f9ae6aa2fecc315e36b60d10bbb0b22bbf3548d5a2381670351e0e", "ja": "この匂いは、アンバーじゃないね～……。\nやっぱり、ハーマンの方か～。", "zh": "这个味道，不是安珀呢～……\n果然还是赫尔曼吗～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "9b0c313f0e66c22c7b94803ea7d169fbd297e4ef8044cbc5a2611e5c8b84830f", "ja": "アンバーじゃなくて、ハーマンって事はぁ……\n僕の邪魔をしに来たのかな～……？", "zh": "既然不是安珀，而是哈曼……也就是说，你是来妨碍我的吧～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "41c13f13c3b95b73d13a5db31ee50f5d32a73ec17b1073ebf46a348f38f9e423", "ja": "そういう事です。\n思い通りにならなくて残念ですね、ゼノビア。", "zh": "就是这样。没能如你所愿，真遗憾呢，泽诺比娅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "73b46e600376c84a5d6c9e52a4913796003c178c858956ecd840faf530926ade", "ja": "ほんと、つまんないの～……。\nつまんないから……。", "zh": "真的，好无聊啊～……  \n因为好无聊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "f2942c7a1babe85e1b80e86ddfe325d0a8a687bb503edae38565edce065e9d65", "ja": "やっぱり死んでよ、ハーマン。", "zh": "你还是去死吧，赫尔曼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1026_003mik", "source_sha256": "0353d806f766f6404be867ec671362f7c808c57d9d2a8ef11e8c4db6cbdcad5d", "ja": "！？　危ない！", "zh": "！？危险！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1027_null", "source_sha256": "44ce8c6d60e264c18472ab075d5ae789de004d5d5e4834ef618f62eafc34c5e1", "ja": "ヒュッ！", "zh": "咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "ff077521eb4c4ebe0038f41a83e3289555193af28c66dca7b8fb0489129dd00e", "ja": "っ……！　ナ、イフ……？\nそんな……っ、ど、こから……。", "zh": "唔……！刀、刀……？\n怎么会……从、从哪里……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1029_003mik", "source_sha256": "d30573fda19746d2853a69ae5e4a0b164a47a065134fe8e370affb3896b946f4", "ja": "ゼノビア！？", "zh": "泽诺比亚！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1030_se", "source_sha256": "29556223bcc261cfb5ccc824ad86d03a7d30df474270881f5e48b9a310a480bb", "ja": "ドサッ……", "zh": "扑通……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1031_030iku", "source_sha256": "73ff39cd719b3bf0e26a211097d9f507ab8058a0fb632ce470f5e01737f0356f", "ja": "やれやれ、間に合ったか。\nこの体じゃ、走るのも大変なんだがな。", "zh": "哎呀呀，总算赶上了吗。\n用这副身体，跑起来可真费劲啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1032_003mik", "source_sha256": "e3201fc2b1a03376ef0ca4d8fc3a1af77010c64596d25adf5c221a854744eb46", "ja": "イーサン……あ、ありがとう……。", "zh": "伊桑……啊，谢谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1033_030iku", "source_sha256": "85f09b06355783e37a48f02019c91b3fae871b73c818cb8d6b30376bb7b418bf", "ja": "お前に礼を言われる筋合いはない。\nそうだろう？　ハーマン。", "zh": "我没什么值得你道谢的。  \n对吧，哈曼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9c499abec78956b156f93bba50efa994c2968c191939c7989b03d1e56d1cbfe5", "ja": "……ああ、そのとおりだ。\n助かったよ、イーサン。", "zh": "……啊啊，你说得没错。\n多亏有你，伊桑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1035_null", "source_sha256": "5b8545a00e4d2e0aece8369653ba9da17997b6434f698d5a8092aec467446348", "ja": "その後、駆けつけた警官隊によってゼノビアは\n厳重に拘束され、再び監獄へと連れ戻された……", "zh": "之后，赶来的警察部队将泽诺比亚严密拘束，重新押回了监狱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2c511636c38b50b15c36fc277f44871dab6c337f001f0a050adf80407bccf4b3", "ja": "ご苦労だった。任務完了だ。\n最初の約束通り、お前達を解放する。", "zh": "辛苦了。任务完成。\n按照最初的约定，释放你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1037_034ayu", "source_sha256": "41a9f8a6b87196a88515ae9e5381bfa0e28100092d4e799d490c8077612c84bf", "ja": "こちらのアタッシェケースには報酬が。\n新しいパスポートも入っている。", "zh": "这个手提箱里有报酬。\n里面还放着新的护照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1038_003mik", "source_sha256": "16b210242edd41509844505ae5255896e57fc3d9c8b1d91b60b5643af9634b68", "ja": "……ハーマン。アンジーは……。", "zh": "……赫尔曼。安吉她……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1039_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9e8f057e2dc5ac9b27fbef90842591b49e8a61435e6fd8c303e987f7126ae9aa", "ja": "……生きてはいる。だが、次に『アンジー』に\n会えるのは、いつになるかわからない。だから……。", "zh": "……还活着。但是，下一次能见到\n“安吉”是什么时候，我也不知道。所以……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1040_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bbccaa3f91be7b9f528aeaeec1e8407ca80ce92324b9de72bce21c6d2b83bfc3", "ja": "さようならだ、スタークス。", "zh": "永别了，斯塔克斯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1042_003mik", "source_sha256": "53b7f3e072b378725217f39b405597311581ae0173d359f412d4254361f44cc9", "ja": "晴れて自由の身だな……。\nお前達、これからどうするんだ？", "zh": "终于自由了……。\n你们，接下来打算怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1043_015siz", "source_sha256": "f9873eee1c982c8c7092ec16da481ae7847778ee27ddafb1dadfe168f824d5c7", "ja": "晴れてというには、些か以上に苦い気分ですけどね。\nさあ、どうしましょうか……。", "zh": "说是苦尽甘来，心里却苦涩得很呢。\n那……该怎么办才好呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1044_030iku", "source_sha256": "f720c0a453d1284ad01a3ff233d5cd8f3fa2ac7535bffeded44e55871f3db5ec", "ja": "……まあ、どうとでもなるだろ。\nどこに向かったとしても、監獄よりはマシだ。", "zh": "……算了，总会有办法的吧。\n不管去哪里，都比待在监狱里强。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_06_1045_003mik", "source_sha256": "3bdc2ecb956a018f0588348933d8d9070ab37d530fe53d96eca39307d9b439b7", "ja": "……ははっ。確かに、そのとおりだな！", "zh": "……哈哈。确实，你说得没错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
